cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PARSEC: harmonizing MODIS and VIIRS active fire records (FireSync)"
type: software
abstract: >-
  PARSEC matches NASA FIRMS active fire detections from MODIS and VIIRS,
  builds a harmonized fire record with an identity baseline and an
  exploratory Bayesian model, and serves it through an API and the
  FireSync web app. Built for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026.
